Package: dahlia-agent
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Dahlia Linux <https://github.com/Fabiy99/dahlia-linux>
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Depends: python3 (>= 3.11), python3-yaml, adduser, systemd, dahlia-storage (= @VERSION@), docker.io | docker-ce, docker-compose (>= 2) | docker-compose-plugin
Description: Dahlia Linux privileged agent
 Root service on /run/dahlia/agent.sock. It accepts a fixed list of
 actions (system info, hostname, storage, jobs, updates, apps), checks every
 parameter and runs the matching system command. The web UI uses it
 instead of root rights. Members of the group dahlia-agent may connect.
